I was expecting Toko to cheekily retort that there was no\nway she could trust a guy who kept getting laid off.%K%P
我本以为她一定会说『你不会守信用吧，失业先生』之类的，\n以这种“收尾”来结束话题的。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dPassing those exams? Finding a good job? Getting married?\n...Being reunited with my mother? Having loads of fun\nliving at the Terrace House Hinosaka till the end of\ntime?\d%K%P
「升学？就职？结婚？\n…还是说，和妈妈再会？\n在Terrace House阳之坂一直开心地生活？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's... um...\d%K%P
「那是…呃…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou should know, right? I mean, if it's your number one\npriority, it would be weird if you didn't.\d%K%P
「肯定是知道的吧？\n最优先考虑我的幸福的话，\n不知道才奇怪吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko...\d%K%P
「都子…」%K%P
Toko showed no intention of switching subjects, and was\nadamant on demanding an answer.%K%P
都子似乎还不想结束这个话题，\n只是直白地寻求着那无聊而又正确的答案。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWill you grant me the kind of happiness I wish for?\d%K%P
「理君…会为我实现的吧？\n实现我所追求的幸福」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell... as long as it's within my power.\d%K%P
「那个…只要我能做到的话，不论是什么都行」%K%P
I...%K%P
所以我…%K%P
...I desperately wanted to give her the reply she wanted,\nbut I wasn't sure what it was. All I could do was blurt\nout a cowardly, ambiguous response.%K%P
想要诚实地回答，可是又不知道正解，\n我只能这样卑劣地逃避了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou said it just now. You said that you'd do everything\nin your power for me. Is that right?\d%K%P
「你说了哦？\n你可是说了只要能做到，不论是什么都行的哦？」%K%P
But Toko wouldn't allow me to escape. She kept the\npressure going.%K%P
但是都子还是想在我的逃避里找到正解，\n被我包在外套里的同时，也把我包围了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm... actually extremely selfish, just so you know.\d%K%P
「我啊…\n其实是非常任性的？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThen you should be yourself.\nYou can be more selfish.\d%K%P
「那样的话，做真正的你就好。\n再任性一点也无妨…」%K%P
Back when Ms. Honoka was still around, Toko worked herself\nto the bone just to survive. Even after her mother left,\nshe kept pressing on.%K%P
她和穗香小姐两人的时候，她拼命咬着牙关努力。\n只有她一个人的时候，她同样拼命得咬着牙关努力。%K%P
She always had to suppress herself to survive, yet she\nstill grew up to be a kind and well-mannered girl. Others\nmight have failed to grant her the environment to unveil\nher selfishness, but I...%K%P
为了生存，一直在压抑自己，\n即使这样，就算是从小就阳光开朗的都子任性起来，\n就算别人都不喜欢，我也…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThe real me is completely different from the one you\nknow...\d%K%P
「不一样的啊…\n和理君知道的都子是不一样的哦」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko...?\d%K%P
「都子…？」%K%P
I felt her tiny shoulders trembling under my arm.%K%P
怀抱着的都子的肩膀，微微地颤抖。%K%P
With her back pressing against my belly and head hung\ndown, Toko likely wanted to prevent me from seeing her\nexpression.%K%P
她的背靠着我…又一次把脸背向我，\n大概是又露出了不愿让我看到的表情吧。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI act like a good girl all the time, when I'm really just\na huge liar. I've no problem being dishonest with others\nand myself, but I always end up regretting it later...\d%K%P
「我只是做出一个好孩子的样子…\n其实是个大家都没想到的大骗子，欺骗别人，欺骗自己，\n可是之后，就会对之前的不诚实感到很后悔…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEveryone has done something they've regretted. At least I\nknow I have, to the point I've even lost count.\d%K%P
「谁都会后悔的。\n…至少我感到后悔的事是不计其数的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIn my heart, I'm envious of everyone and everything, and\nI'm possessive beyond all reason. I'm a child who never\nconsiders the happiness or circumstances of others, and I\nrefuse to endure anything I don't like.\d%K%P
「在心底深处总是在嫉妒别人，独占欲又强，\n又是个不会考虑别人立场的任性孩子，\n这种令人讨厌的心情，真是再也忍不下去了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou have been enduring all your life.\nYou're simply too hard on yourself, that's all.\d%K%P
「如果你忍耐的话，会比别人要辛苦一倍的吧…\n你对自己要求太严格了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dListen to me! It doesn't matter if something belongs to\nanother person. I can't help wanting it for myself!\d%K%P
「可是！\n我根本就不会考虑到别人啊？\n只是自己的一厢情愿，就想要将其得到手了啊？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
I wasn't sure what she was trying to say.%K%P
搞不懂。%K%P
I didn't know what she wanted or whom it belonged to. Or\neven why she couldn't have it in the first place.%K%P
都子到底在追求什么，那个东西本来又是谁的，\n为什么不会让给都子，搞不懂。%K%P
I was drawing a complete blank.%K%P
有什么东西把我的思考回路阻断了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnd what's worse is that I can't even properly convey\nthat to other people. I deserve none of the things you do\nfor me.\d%K%P
「然后，这种无法向人诉说的阴暗，大概是没救了吧。\n这样的我…没有资格被理君守护啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's... complete nonsense.\d%K%P
「不可能的…这样的事情」%K%P
And so, all I could do now...%K%P
所以，现在只能…%K%P
...was pray that Toko wouldn't notice the ceaseless\nbeating of my heart.%K%P
祈求神明，\n不要让都子听到我剧烈的心跳声。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI shouldn't even be thinking about this right now.\nI have a far bigger and way more important goal ahead of\nme, but...\d%K%P
「明明不是考虑这种事情的时候啊。\n现在我眼前明明就有个大目标的…」%K%P
But I knew that was a vain hope at best.%K%P
可是，\n我又知道这是个不可能实现的愿望。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhy must this be so painful? Why is it so hard to\nendure...?\d%K%P
「但为什么会这么难受？这么痛苦呢…？」%K%P
After all...%K%P
要说为什么的话…%K%P
...not only did I hear Toko's heart racing, I could feel\nher trembling under my coat.%K%P
从都子体内传来的，\n让人难以置信的剧烈心跳，\n接二连三地冲击着我。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm such an idiot...\nI could have at least picked a better timing for this...\d%K%P
「我真是个十足的傻瓜…\n为什么要在这样的时候醒悟过来」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko...\d%K%P
「都子…」%K%P
I tightened my embrace around her.%K%P
我从背后使劲抱住了\n自言自语、不停自嘲的都子。%K%P
Was I driven by parental worry? The empathy of a close\nfriend? Or perhaps...%K%P
像是担心孩子的父母一样…？\n因为爱情？因为亲情？因为友情？%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOsamu...\d%K%P
「理君…」%K%P
I... I could no longer make sense of anything.%K%P
我不知道…\n什么也不知道。%K%P
What... was this...?%K%P
因为，这究竟是什么…？%K%P
Lately... I felt as though Toko was becoming more and more\nbeautiful with each passing day.%K%P
最近…\n都子以令我恐惧的势头，\n变得越来越漂亮了。%K%P
She was an attractive girl to begin with, but...%K%P
她原本就是个漂亮而可爱的孩子，这毋庸置疑。%K%P
...the Toko before me now had learned to make an\nexpression that burned with passion, was laced with fickle\nmelancholy, and exuded an uncannily bewitching air.%K%P
但是现在的都子…\n仿佛露出了强烈、悲伤、虚幻、\n以及美丽的表情。%K%P
And it wasn't just her face... I could sense it in her\nvoice, her breathing, even her scent... All of it was\ntrying to lure me into a sweet trap.%K%P
不光是表情。\n声音、气息，甚至是气味\n…全都诱惑着我，让我欲罢不能。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUm, Osamu.\d%K%P
「呐，理君」%K%P
