%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dCongratulations, Ozeki.\nLooks like your efforts really did pay off. I'm happy for\nyou.\d%K%P
「啊，恭喜你啊尾关。\n太好了，你的努力终于有了回报」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
