「到春假就要立刻去参加练习了，\n所以我也差不多得开始锻炼了。\n…身体会迟钝到何种地步，想想都可怕」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYup... that sure is incredible. ...I mean, I've only seen\nyou play once, but that was enough for me to realize you\nmight have some genuine talent!\d%K%P
「嗯、嗯，真的好厉害。\n…啊～，那个，虽然只看过一场比赛，\n但总感觉能明白你的厉害之处！」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dSo yeah, this marks the end of our study group.\nThanks for everything, Hinosaka.\d%K%P
