%LC美都子
\dI guess so...\d%K%P
「算是吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThey're both going to panic if they see these results. I\ncan see Osamu breaking out in a fever and getting\nhospitalized. ...I can't possibly tell him about this.\d%K%P
「带着这样的结果回去，那两人肯定都要陷入恐慌了。\n理说不定睡觉的时候还会发烧。\n…我真是无法对他们说出口啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'll tell him...\nYou don't need to go out of your way to meet him.\d%K%P
「我会说的，所以没事啦…\n老师也没必要去见理君啦」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh... I'm sorry. What am I even doing, shifting all the\nblame to my student... I'm sure you're the most shocked\nabout this.\d%K%P
「啊～…对不起。\n我怎么责备起学生来了。\n明明现在最受打击的应该是美都子」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNot really...\nI kinda knew it'd be like this after I finished the\nexams.\d%K%P
「倒也没有…\n考试结束的时候我就已经预见到这样的结果了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dBut why...? Are you sure you don't know what happened?\nOr is it something you can't tell me?\d%K%P
