%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI guess I could tell you, but...\d%K%P
「倒也不是不能说…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThen tell me. I don't think of you as just another one of\nmy students, okay? Besides, I have yet to return the favor\nfor earlier.\d%K%P
「那就说出来吧。\n我并不觉得和你只是单纯的师生关系。\n而且…之前欠的人情我还没还呢，对吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI don't remember doing you any favors.\d%K%P
「我不记得有给老师做过什么事啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI lived at your house -- the Terrace House Hinosaka --\nfor almost a month.\d%K%P
「不是给你添了一个月的麻烦么。\n在Terrace House阳之坂」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou have Osamu to thank for that. A landlord doesn't have\nthe right to decide how many people are eligible to stay\nin a single room.\d%K%P
