%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThat's not all... You kept making us food until Osamu\nrecovered. You were a tremendous help with everything.\d%K%P
「不是这样的…\n在理治疗的那段时间，一直都是你照顾饮食，\n真是，私人的事情什么都得麻烦你…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI... I'd do anything for Osamu. Just like you.\d%K%P
