Five minutes earlier than the time we agreed upon.%K%P
离约定时间还差５分钟。%K%P
She waited for me patiently and without fidgeting around,\njust like on Christmas Day.%K%P
麻实就像平安夜那天一样，\n没有一点慌张和焦躁，\n只是平静地等着我到来。%K%P
