%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOsamu...\d%K%P
「理…」%K%P
Asami was once again wearing unusually high heels just to\nmatch my own height. She must've changed into them on her\nway here.%K%P
她今天也是在来的路上换了鞋子吧，\n高高的鞋跟让她与我的身高相配了。%K%P
She had her usual suit on, but despite coming here\nstraight from work, her makeup seemed to be freshly done.\nAnd as I realized all the extra trouble she went through\njust to meet me...%K%P
衣服倒是平常上班的衣服，\n似乎下班回家之后，也有化妆。\n能看得出来为了跟我见面，做了很多准备…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSorry... Just for a little bit.\d%K%P
「抱歉…就一下」%K%P
Much like last time, I was overcome by an urge to hold her\nclose. To feel her presence.%K%P
就像之前一样，\n我想要用眼睛之外的感官，\n来确认麻实的存在了。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOsamu... everyone's looking.\d%K%P
