%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'll let you go in a second.\nIt's just for a little while...\d%K%P
「马上就好。\n再一小会儿…」%K%P
Asami's hair was right below my nose.%K%P
麻实的发香很快传到了我的鼻子里。%K%P
I pulled her head to my chest and closed my eyes before\ntaking a slow, deep breath to inhale her sweet fragrance.%K%P
像是抱着她的头一样，让她伏在我的胸口，\n慢慢地，闭上眼睛，反复深呼吸。%K%P
