I was pretty sure Toko wasn't acting -that- strange.%K%P
是啊…都子并没有表现出“那样程度”的奇怪。%K%P
She would occasionally make some fairly confusing facial\nexpressions... but that was about it.%K%P
除了有的时候，在那么一瞬间，\n她会用让我疑惑的表情看我。%K%P
