%LC麻实
\dNormal...?\d%K%P
「跟平常一样…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI-I think so...\d%K%P
「至、至少都子她…」%K%P
Aside from some damage to my nerves, the holidays went by\nwithout any incident of note... In other words, it was\nnormal.%K%P
…除去“那个”对我的精神卫生有着致命性影响的东西，\n寒假时我们和睦地度过了二人时间。%K%P
I spent so much time with her over the past few days that\nthe Christmas Eve I had with Asami started to feel almost\nlike a distant dream.%K%P
正因为如此，我和都子两人度过的正月，\n甚至让我感觉平安夜那天晚上、和麻实在一起的那天晚上，\n不过是除夕那天所做的初梦罢了。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIs she smiling?\d%K%P
「她有好好笑么？」%K%P
