%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOver winter break, too?\nShe wasn't being unusually nice to you, was she?\d%K%P
「寒假的时候也是？\n理有温柔对她吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWe spent most of the holidays lazing around, watching TV\nin her room, and snacking on leftovers from New Year's.\d%K%P
「这三天都是在家里宅呢。\n在都子的房间里看电视，吃年饭，打盹…」%K%P
One time, I nodded off in her room after having a couple\nbeers and only woke up the next day...%K%P
也有在都子房间喝屠苏酒啤酒日本酒之后，\n就在被炉里睡着不知道什么时候就到早上了的时候。%K%P
...because Himeo kicked me awake when she came over,\nalmost like I was some soccer ball.%K%P
…不过会被第二天过来拜年的姬绪小姐像足球一样踢飞就是了。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou spent the entire holiday... together?\d%K%P
「一直…在一起？」%K%P
