%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
But Toko simply laughed off all of Himeo's complaints and\nspent the remainder of the day with me.%K%P
但是都子连一点自觉都没有，笑得咯咯出声，\n之后也并没有从我旁边起身。%K%P
Spending that much time with Toko revealed a new side of\nher as a little troublemaker: she'd tickle my feet and try\nwrestling maneuvers on me whenever I let my guard down.%K%P
一边用脚趾挠我脚心，\n一边使用自称的摔跤技，拿她的腿来锁住我的腿。\n就是这样的有点过分淘气的年初。%K%P
Depending on one's interpretation, these could've been\nseen as desperate attempts to keep me in her room...\nAlthough that was probably just me reading too much into\nthings.%K%P
岂止如此，我要回去自己的房间，或者是要外出的时候，\n她好像会尽力阻止我…大概是我想多了吧。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt sure was exhausting, but these three days were nothing\nif not fulfilling. I don't think I've ever had this much\nfun during New Year's.\d%K%P
