%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
It was both fun and exhausting. Which would explain why I\nhad trouble sleeping during that period.%K%P
热闹，疲惫…\n所以，没错…\n夜里没法平静下来，也睡不着。%K%P
And also why I felt like my heart could burst open unless\nI met Asami and breathed in her relaxing fragrance.%K%P
像这样把麻实叫出来，\n呼吸着混有她气息的空气，\n感觉不知什么时候心脏就会破裂了…%K%P
