I doubted that anyone -- not the staff or the other guests\n-- had any experience dealing with drunk customers in this\nestablishment.%K%P
在香泽里拉这里喝醉的话，\n不管是饭店一方还是顾客一方，\n都不能不说是预料之外的事态。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dGood grief... Why do I have to be put in this position...\nHow dare she... How dare she say those things...!\d%K%P
