%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI-I'm sorry...\d%K%P
「对、对不起…」%K%P
I wanted to leave as soon as possible...\nI could feel the piercing gaze of the staff and the dining\nfamilies on my skin...%K%P
想早点走了…\n店员还有带着小孩的客人，他们的视线好扎人…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHahhh... but seriously...\nI can understand how she feels...\d%K%P
「哈啊啊啊啊…但是，\n那家伙的心情我也不是不能理解…」%K%P
What was up with her today?%K%P
麻实究竟怎么了？%K%P
I had known her for years, but I'd probably never seen her\nopenly display this much anger towards someone.%K%P
麻实这样明显地表达出对一个人的怒意，\n即便是对交往时间感到自负的我，\n也几乎是没有见到过的。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dBut... seriously... it's her own fault we ended up like\nthis...\d%K%P
