If anything, Asami had a very reserved demeanor when it\ncame to things like this -- she would usually just smile\napologetically, and I'd be the one getting emotional.%K%P
那个时候的麻实，莫名其妙地表现出一种虚无感，\n不管我当时多么抓狂，也只是一副惭愧的样子，\n在那里微微苦笑。%K%P
