%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...What?\d%K%P
「………什么？」%K%P
I almost missed it because of how nonchalantly she said it\nafter that fit of anger, but that was by no means a small\nissue.%K%P
就在麻实怒气消散，好不容易要一带而过的势头下，\n她却干脆地说出了一件不得了的事。%K%P
A problem that had been put on hold for two months...%K%P
从两个月之前一直保留到现在的…%K%P
A marriage proposal from someone three years her junior,\none that Asami gave no answer to -- even during the period\nshe was nursing me back to health.%K%P
